  "seoBody": "<h2>Apps nobody opens</h2><p>Most inspection apps ask you to download, sign up and learn something new. Here you use WhatsApp. Nothing to install.</p><h2>A report, not a photo dump</h2><p>Every Check ends as a report. Each Fault is listed with its place. See our <a href=\"/pages/services.html\">workflows page</a>.</p><h2>Safety walks and fleet checks</h2><p>Send your own checklist and it becomes a guided WhatsApp walk. Pre-trip and post-trip vehicle checks run the same way.</p><h2>Questions</h2><h3>Do I need to install a new app?</h3><p>No. You answer in WhatsApp by text, voice note or photo.</p><h3>Can Quickler handle OSHA-style site safety self-inspections?</h3><p>Yes. Send your own checklist, including OSHA-modelled formats, and it becomes a guided WhatsApp walk. It is not an official OSHA product and does not certify compliance.</p><h3>What about driver vehicle inspections?</h3><p>Yes. Pre-trip and post-trip checks run in WhatsApp. Defects flag red at once. Voice notes capture the detail.</p><h3>Where is the data stored?</h3><p>On EU servers in Germany, handled in line with GDPR.</p><p>Read our <a href=\"/pages/guides.html\">guides</a>, try the <a href=\"/pages/demo.html\">demo</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">contact us</a>. See <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">global field compliance</a>, our <a href=\"/pages/services.html\">workflows</a> and the <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html\">help centre</a>.</p>",
